<p>05-Apr-97     655,000	 31,000     1,717,000	72,000</p>
<p>Change:	   1.5%	    0.0%	    0.1%	 -4.2%</p>
<p>13-Apr-96     673,000	 28,000     1,777,000	85,000</p>
<p>Change:	  -1.2%	   10.7%	   -3.3%	-18.8%</p>
<p>1997 YTD:    9,887,000     449,000    25,102,000   1,120,000</p>
<p>1996 YTD:*  10,072,000     477,000    26,793,000   1,292,000</p>
<p>Change:	  -1.8%	   -5.8%	   -6.3%	-13.3%</p>
